This is my vintage brown & brass key fob, the perfect accessory for any lifestyle. Made with high-quality chocolate leather, this key fob comes equipped with a spring closing and key ring. With dimensions of 2.5x14cm (approx.), it's the perfect size to slip into your pocket or attach to your bag for easy access to your keys. Some clients even attach it to their jeans’ belt keeper.
But that's not all – this key fob is also compatible with the leather belt, completing the look for any occasion. Whether you're traveling, running errands, or just enjoying a night out, this key fob is the perfect addition.
Available on demand.

